# Feedback storage + reviews wall, and contact-form leads (Supabase)
# The contact form writes project inquiries, the feedback form writes reviews,
# and the reviews wall reads the approved ones. Both values are PUBLIC (the URL
# is your project endpoint; the publishable key only acts as the RLS-restricted
# `anon` role) so they ship to the browser as NEXT_PUBLIC_ vars. Do NOT put the
# service-role key or a personal access token here.
# Find these in Supabase → Project Settings → API. Copy this file to .env.local.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_your-publishable-key

# Google Analytics 4 (optional). The measurement ID is public — it ships in the
# client bundle. GA loads only after the visitor accepts the cookie banner; no
# GA cookies are set before that. Leave unset to disable analytics + the banner.
# Find it in GA Admin → Data Streams → your stream → Measurement ID (G-XXXXXXX).
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=
